+/*
+ * ponytail: a one-shot report for the intermittent enumeration failure, see
+ * "The gadget sometimes never takes an address" in NOTES.md. It fires 15
+ * seconds after the gadget starts, long after enumeration has succeeded or
+ * the host has given up, so it cannot shift the timing it is there to watch.
+ * If the line never appears the kernel hung. If it does, the counters say
+ * whether the controller stopped interrupting or the gadget stopped
+ * answering. Remove it once a failing boot has been caught.
